"enhance_help" = "How to test whisper boost…";
"enhance_instructions" = "Select a physical mic in Mic KeepAlive. Enable whisper boost, choose +6 or +12 dB, then start keep-alive. In WeType or your dictation app, explicitly select BlackHole 2ch as its microphone. Do not select BlackHole as the physical source or change your music output.\n\nCompare the same quiet sentence using the physical mic and BlackHole. Raise to +18 dB only if needed; noise is amplified too. There is no AI denoising.\n\nStopping keep-alive stops all audio sent to BlackHole. Change dictation input back to the physical mic when finished. Enhancement is off after relaunch; gain defaults to +12 dB. AirPods capture can still change music quality. No recordings or uploads.";
